EnergyCommunity.core.telemetry

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Encapsulates backend calculation algorithms, data stream aggregation, and telemetry processing.
- Handles generation and consumption simulations (e.g. solar production curves, household power demand).
- Maintains fast-access read models and aggregated statistics derived from event streams.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: INTERNAL to the backend core.
- Boundary Rule: Decoupled from direct persistent writes. Consumes streaming telemetry events from the message broker and builds independent read views.
- Metric and calculation results are published or exposed to clients through core.api contracts.
